{"t":"SHOP","made":"2026-11-27 02:42","name":"Shopify Inc.","ko":"쇼피파이","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","employees":7600,"hq":"Ottawa, ON, Canada","website":"https://www.shopify.com","summary_en":"Shopify Inc., a commerce technology company, provides tools to start, scale, market, and run a business of various sizes in Canada, the United States, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, and Latin America. The Company offers Shopify platform that enables merchants to manage products and inventory, process orders and payments, fulfill and ship orders, build customer relationships, source products, leverage analytics, and reporting and access financing for running their business across all of their sales channels, including web and mobile storefronts, physical retail locations, social media storefronts, and marketplaces. It also provides Shopify Payments, a fully integrated payment processing service that allows merchants to accept and process payment cards online and offline. In addition, the company engages in the sale of themes and apps; shipping labels through Shopify Shipping; point-of-sale hardware; advertising on the Shopify App Store; and Shop Campaigns for buyer acquisitions, as well as registration of domain names. The company was formerly known as Jaded Pixel Technologies Inc. and changed its name to Shopify Inc. in November 2011. Shopify Inc. was incorporated in 2004 and is based in Ottawa, Canada.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"상거래 기술 회사인 Shopify Inc.는 캐나다, 미국, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카, 아시아 태평양 및 라틴 아메리카에서 다양한 규모의 비즈니스를 시작, 확장, 마케팅 및 운영하는 데 필요한 도구를 제공합니다. 회사는 판매자가 웹 및 모바일 매장, 실제 소매점, 소셜 미디어 매장 및 마켓플레이스를 포함한 모든 판매 채널에서 제품 및 재고 관리, 주문 및 결제 처리, 주문 이행 및 배송, 고객 관계 구축, 제품 소싱, 분석 활용, 보고 및 자금 조달에 액세스할 수 있도록 하는 Shopify 플랫폼을 제공합니다. 또한 판매자가 온라인과 오프라인에서 결제 카드를 수락하고 처리할 수 있는 완전히 통합된 결제 처리 서비스인 Shopify Payments도 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 테마 및 앱 판매에 종사하고 있습니다. Shopify Shipping을 통한 배송 라벨 POS 하드웨어; Shopify 앱 스토어에 광고 구매자 획득 및 도메인 이름 등록을 위한 쇼핑 캠페인. 이 회사는 이전에 Jaded Pixel Technologies Inc.로 알려졌으며 2011년 11월에 Shopify Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Shopify Inc.는 2004년에 법인화되었으며 캐나다 오타와에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":133.4,"mcap":171622023168.0,"pe":81.840485,"fpe":54.227196,"peg":1.4518,"ps":12.114211,"pb":13.459791,"ev_ebitda":64.561,"div":0.0,"beta":2.664,"hi52":180.88,"lo52":94.0},"fin":{"rev":14167000064.0,"rev_g":0.316,"eps_g":0.795,"gross":0.47491002,"op":0.1807,"net":0.15007,"roe":0.16833,"fcf":1640999936.0,"cash":4727000064.0,"debt":188000000.0,"de":1.475,"eps":1.63,"feps":2.46002},"own":{"short":0.0146,"inst":0.74388003,"insider":0.00233},"analyst":{"n":49,"mean":177.18408,"median":180.0,"high":220.0,"low":120.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.66667,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":10,"buy":32,"hold":11,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":10,"buy":32,"hold":12,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":11,"buy":32,"hold":11,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":11,"buy":31,"hold":11,"sell":1,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-05","Firm":"Argus Research","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":180.0,"priorPriceTarget":180.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":160.0,"priorPriceTarget":145.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"RBC Capital","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":200.0,"priorPriceTarget":200.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":205.0,"priorPriceTarget":208.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Wedbush","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":176.0,"priorPriceTarget":176.0},{"Grade